  "id": "chipotle-chicken-tinga",
  "name": "Chipotle Chicken Tinga",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken in a smoky tomato-chipotle sauce",
  "description": "Chicken thighs simmer in a smoky tomato sauce, then are topped with a fresh lime-and-coriander salsa and served with tortilla chips and guacamole.",
